# Internal context/handoff docs are intentionally tracked in git (for portability
# across machines) but must NOT be served on the public site. Cloudflare Pages
# follows these redirects even when a matching static asset exists, so the file
# bytes are never sent — the request 301s to the homepage instead.
/CLAUDE.md / 301
/docs/* / 301

# Keep the printed QR destination stable even if the hosted schedule format changes.
/homecoming-2026 /Homecoming-Flyer-2026.pdf 302
/homecoming-2026/ /Homecoming-Flyer-2026.pdf 302
